{"ts": "2026-08-17T12:23:01Z", "agent": "claude-edits", "seq": 41, "kind": "tool_result", "text": "developer.role\npr-reviewer-local.role\npr-reviewer.role\nproduct-manager.role\nresearcher.role\nretrospective.role\nreviewer.role\ntester.role\nux-designer.role\n---\n# SCOPES lets one role be dispatched several times concurrently, one per\n# scope, when the work genuinely splits. The pipeline decides per story how\n# many of these it actually uses -- a backend-only change dispatches once.\nLABEL=Developer\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=developer.md\nSCOPES=frontend,backend\nDESCRIPTION=Implements the story; may run once per scope in parallel\n# The dissenting voice, on the local model. qwen2.5:7b scored 5/5 on the tool\n# protocol harness and is fast and free; its job here is to disagree, not to\n# be authoritative. Change ENGINE/MODEL freely -- that is the whole point of\n# this file existing.\nLABEL=PR reviewer (local)\nENGINE=aider\nMODEL=qwen2.5:7b\nDEFINITION=pr-reviewer.md\nDESCRIPTION=The second, deliberately different voice in the PR debate\n# One voice in the PR debate. The other voice is deliberately a different\n# model -- see pr-reviewer-local.role. Disagreement is the point.\nLABEL=PR reviewer\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=pr-reviewer.md\nDESCRIPTION=Argues one reading of the change in the PR review debate\nLABEL=Product manager\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=product-manager.md\nDESCRIPTION=Triages, scopes, and writes the story with falsifiable acceptance criteria\n# Read-only investigation. Claude by measurement: local models handle single\n# decisions but break down tracing a chain across files (docs/agent-rework/MODELS.md).\nLABEL=Researcher\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=researcher.md\nDESCRIPTION=Traces a problem to its root-cause line; never edits\n# Runs after each dogfood round. Deliberately scoped to editing the pipeline's\n# own instructions (agents/*.md, roles.d/*.role) and nothing else -- a bad\n# prompt edit is revertible in one commit, a bad machinery edit breaks every\n# future round.\nLABEL=Retrospective\nENGINE=claude-edits\nDEFINITION=retrospective.md\nDESCRIPTION=Turns one round's evidence into an improvement the next round inherits\nLABEL=Reviewer\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=reviewer.md\nDESCRIPTION=Runs the diff past the six-lens review panel; never edits\nLABEL=Tester\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=tester.md\nDESCRIPTION=Writes and runs real tests against the acceptance criteria\nLABEL=UX designer\nENGINE=claude\nDEFINITION=ux-designer.md\nDESCRIPTION=Turns the story into concrete states and layout before code exists", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01HuNyQXBVSAVaay2tVAo3qs", "session_id": "744b1940-c4ba-4635-afb0-ac675d200ec2"}}
